
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>CSS Styling</title>

    <style>
        body {
            background-color: lightyellow;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            text-align: center;
        }

        h1 {
            color: darkblue;
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
            font-size: 36px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: darkred;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        p {
            color: darkgreen;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        .box {
            background-color: lightblue;
            border: 2px solid navy;
            padding: 20px;
            margin: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .special {
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <h1>Welcome to My Webpage</h1>

    <h2>CSS Styling Example</h2>

    <div class="box">
        <p>This webpage demonstrates different CSS properties.</p>

        <p class="special">
            CSS makes webpages attractive and beautiful!
        </p>
    </div>

    <p>Font, color, size and background are styled using CSS.</p>

</body>
</html>
